# 26. Overfitting Observation in the DNN

The DNN training graph shows an important pattern.

Training accuracy continues increasing, while validation accuracy fluctuates.

The paper observes a noticeable gap between training and validation performance after approximately the 10th epoch, which it interprets as a possible sign of overfitting.

This is another reason why simply increasing model complexity does not automatically produce a better model.

