# 46. Why Confusion Matrix Matters

For three classes:

```text
                Predicted
              N      S      P
Actual N
       S
       P
```

The confusion matrix allows us to identify:

* Normal → Normal
* Normal → Suspect
* Normal → Pathological
* Suspect → Normal
* Suspect → Suspect
* Suspect → Pathological
* Pathological → Normal
* Pathological → Suspect
* Pathological → Pathological

This is more informative than a single accuracy number because it shows which classes are being confused.

